WEBVTT

00:07:27.697 --> 00:07:30.562
We did everything that letter told us to do,

00:07:30.562 --> 00:07:33.364
and still I know there must be more.

00:07:33.364 --> 00:07:35.042
Now I'm here with a genuine expert.

00:07:35.042 --> 00:07:39.801
Tell me. What should I do to save energy?"

00:07:39.801 --> 00:07:43.853
There are many experts who can help answer Harriet's question.

00:07:43.853 --> 00:07:45.915
My goal is to make sure

00:07:45.915 --> 00:07:48.213
we are all asking it.

00:07:48.213 --> 00:07:49.571
Thank you.

00:07:49.571 --> 00:07:54.174
(Applause)